    "title": "Holiday chill arrives for Thanksgiving - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Yolanda Amadeo ,\n6 hours ago ALBANY, Ga. (WALB) - A week of changes with record warmth, beneficial rain and now a plunge of arctic air just in time for the holiday. Early Wednesday a cold front brought a few pockets of heavy rain with 3-5″ in isolated areas. Otherwise under a 0.10″ as a line of showers and storms quickly fell apart and weakened. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
